  Moving around:                                                                                                                               
  Ctrl+A          — go to beginning of line                                                                                                    
  Ctrl+E          — go to end of line                                                                                                          
  Option+←/→      — move word by word (what you already use)                                                                                   
  Ctrl+←/→        — also moves word by word (in some terminals)                                                                                
                                                                                                                                               
  Deleting:                                                                                                                                    
  Ctrl+W          — delete word backwards                                                                                                      
  Option+D        — delete word forwards                                                                                                       
  Ctrl+K          — delete from cursor to end of line                                                                                          
  Ctrl+U          — delete from cursor to beginning of line                                                                                    
  Ctrl+H          — delete one character back (like backspace)                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                               
  History:                                                                                                                                     
  Ctrl+R          — search command history (type to filter, Ctrl+R again for next match)                                                       
  Ctrl+P / ↑      — previous command                                                                                                           
  Ctrl+N / ↓      — next command                                                                                                               
  !!              — repeat last command                                                                                                        
  !$              — last argument of previous command                                                                                          
                                                                                                                                               
  Other handy ones:                                                                                                                            
  Ctrl+L          — clear screen (same as `clear`)                                                                                             
  Ctrl+C          — cancel current command                                                                                                     
  Ctrl+Z          — suspend process (bring back with `fg`)                                                                                     
  Ctrl+D          — exit shell / EOF                                                                                                           
  Tab             — autocomplete                                                                                                               
  Tab Tab         — show all completions                                                                                                       
 
